{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/59b7577ea032d8be5a57eb607020b9d2.poster.avif?t=1760373135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/59b7577ea032d8be5a57eb607020b9d2.webm?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/59b7577ea032d8be5a57eb607020b9d2.mp4?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When Light Fades, What Remains?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bandi, the last spark of light, in a universe consumed by shadows. With the darkness ever-increasing, you find yourself on the last remaining planet where a faint flicker of light draws near. Guided by its warmth, you set out on a journey to restore light to the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/572935fcf0f9b5d8dffa607642bf08b3.poster.avif?t=1760373135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/572935fcf0f9b5d8dffa607642bf08b3.webm?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/572935fcf0f9b5d8dffa607642bf08b3.mp4?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fight for the Universe\u2019s Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towering and relentless, the Colossi stand between you and your goal. These stone-cold titans of annihilation will stop at nothing to extinguish your fading light. To them, you were never meant to exist. To them, you are a mistake they must correct. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/f3b04ccb9e1242412127c2b80f05a6e5.poster.avif?t=1760373135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/f3b04ccb9e1242412127c2b80f05a6e5.webm?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/f3b04ccb9e1242412127c2b80f05a6e5.mp4?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolving Battles, Endless Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light Odyssey is a soulslike boss rush where you face each Colossus in three deadly phases. Fight for the universe\u2019s survival as each phase brings new attacks, new patterns, and new stakes. Learn, master, and adapt as the darkness creeps up on you in total silence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/f7ec82926976db6f7e41bc890ed2e7d4.poster.avif?t=1760373135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/f7ec82926976db6f7e41bc890ed2e7d4.webm?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/f7ec82926976db6f7e41bc890ed2e7d4.mp4?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Secrets of a Lost World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights, explore the ruins of a long-lost civilization. Solve ancient puzzles, decipher cryptic messages, and uncover the true origin of the Colossi. Each discovery will pull you deeper into the history of a world that once knew light\u2014and the price paid to keep it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1902860?t=1760373135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760373135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/ff4b1a2fa98e6c068ff134ec6b093148359d350c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760373135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/ff4b1a2fa98e6c068ff134ec6b093148359d350c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760373135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2441050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/59b7577ea032d8be5a57eb607020b9d2.poster.avif?t=1760373135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/59b7577ea032d8be5a57eb607020b9d2.webm?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902860/extras/59b7577ea032d8be5a57eb607020b9d2.mp4?t=1760373135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When Light Fades, What Remains?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bandi, the last spark of light, in a u